  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Required area\n$\\begin{aligned}\n& A=2\\left[\\int_0^2\\left(3 \\sqrt{y}-\\frac{\\sqrt{y}}{2}\\right) d y\\right]=2 \\int_0^2 \\frac{5 \\sqrt{y}}{2} d y \\\\\n& =5\\left[\\frac{y^{3 / 2}}{3 / 2}\\right]_0^2=\\frac{10}{3}\\left[2^{3 / 2}-0\\right]=\\frac{20 \\sqrt{2}}{3}\n\\end{aligned}$\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/fWHtA4DS4sWU-eu8q4PM8bS_o6_CztJVndJntFL6rpM.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
